Package: @PACKAGE@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Agentcoin Ops <ops@agentcoin.work>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: nodejs (>= 20), bubblewrap, systemd, adduser, curl
Recommends: ca-certificates
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://agentcoin.work
Description: Agentcoin ops daemon (evidence-gated engineering loop)
 Runs a single-node orchestrator: durable queue, planner that creates a task
 only from a proven discrepancy, read-only status API on loopback, watchdog and
 pinned-runtime gate. The package ships systemd units, configuration and the
 sandbox dependency (bubblewrap), creates an unprivileged service user and
 seeds mission/registry without overwriting existing data.
 .
 The package contains no secrets, private keys or production configuration and
 cannot deploy: the deployer unit is not included.
